OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is folic acid being added to
OL,4,Abread flour?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBakers and millers say their customers
OL,7,Fare asking why folic acid is now being
OL,8,Fput into their products.
OL,10,FThe government is giving manufacturers
OL,11,Funtil the end of 2026 to conform to the
OL,12,Fnew legal requirement, announced in
OL,13,F2024, that folic acid should be added
OL,14,Fto non-wholemeal wheat flour.
OL,16,FShipton Mill, in Tetbury, said it had
OL,17,Fbeen receiving "20 emails a week" about
OL,18,Fthe issue while Hobbs House Bakery,
OL,19,Fwhich has stores in Gloucestershire and
OL,20,FBristol, has had questions about it on
OL,21,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
